{"id":841806,"title":"07｜内嵌对话框","content":"内嵌对话框是通过快捷键Ctrl+K调用的代码编辑工具，主要用于生成、解释和修改代码。使用时需注意选择正确的代码段以确保修改位置准确。该工具能直接生成代码如快速排序函数，为代码添加注释，处理try-catch异常，并自动生成详细的测试用例。对于编写注释，内嵌对话框提供了便捷且详尽的解决方案，优于人工编写的注释质量。此外，在终端中，内嵌对话框可以辅助编写运行命令，包括执行Python文件、目录操作及安装第三方库等。问答模式下，通过Alt+Enter进入，用户可与工具进行多轮对话，获取关于代码的详细信息或指导，最终可通过输入“do it”执行建议的操作。总之，内嵌对话框极大提升了编程效率和代码质量。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":397197,"user_name":"8000tank","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3838010,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"C5DC98A0EB57CE","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1737196405,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144131,"content":"不是吧？我昨天还在使用呀。看看是不是快捷键跟其他软件冲突了呢？","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1737343622,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":397197,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"老师，内嵌对话框（inline chat）模式，是不是在Cursor的0.44版本中取消了？不论是快捷键还是找命令尝试过都没法激活了好像……-_-||","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":656320,"discussion_content":"不是吧？我昨天还在使用呀。看看是不是快捷键跟其他软件冲突了呢？","content_length":31,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1737343622,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":397689,"user_name":"Peter","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1139456,"ip_address":"美国","ucode":"9134384E270966","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/63/00/c0731586.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":17393